From 414d23452fafe02546332cbdc33e30dc2b6e8840 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Port Bot <port@local>
Date: Thu, 21 May 2026 18:18:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: oidc login debug logs (backend + frontend)

Adds tracing-level debug logs across the OIDC login flow so an operator
can follow a single login from the initial /auth/login redirect through
callback, session creation, token refresh, and (if enabled) token
exchange. Backend uses klog.V(2) so logs are off by default and enabled
with -v=2. Frontend uses console.debug with an [oidc-debug] prefix so
they can be filtered in DevTools without changing the source. Tokens
and other secrets are never logged in full.
